tions, making timetable management faster, more organized, and efficient.", "image": "image/upload/v1777864681/bcebnijdlfm6kfzoczjj.png", "github_link": "https://github.com/premsaivalluru/Smart_Time_Table_Management_System.git", "execution_link": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/premsaivalluru_smart-timetable-management-system-django-activity-7427744156590063617-GvXk?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAFlr0XYBkZAWywAqc_EyX65QB8ug", "features": ["Automated timetable generation", "Role-based authentication", "Secure login and access control system", "Faculty lecture swap request and approval workflow", "Real-time notifications for schedule updates and swap requests", "Responsive and user-friendly dashboard interface", "Database-driven scheduling using Django ORM and SQLite/MySQL"], "short_description": "A full-stack Django-based timetable management system that automates schedule generation, manages role-based access for admins, faculty, and students, and streamlines lecture swap requests with real-time notifications.", "domain": "Web Dev", "tech_stack": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]}}, {"model": "portfolio.project", "pk": 2, "fields": {"title": "Community Support and Information Platform", "description": "The Community Support Platform is a full-stack web application designed to encourage collaboration on community-driven initiatives and social impact projects. The platform allows users to propose ideas, share media, and collaborate securely through OTP-based authentication. Built with Django and integrated with the Twilio API, the system ensures secure user verification and reliable content management for community engagement.", "image": "image/upload/v1777864842/iw2ygdnj3radz8bfyy1h.png", "github_link": "https://github.com/premsaivalluru/Community-Support-and-Information-Platform.git", "execution_link": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/premsaivalluru_smart-timetable-management-system-django-activity-7427744156590063617-GvXk?utm_source=share&utm_medium=member_desktop&rcm=ACoAAFlr0XYBkZAWywAqc_EyX65QB8ug", "features": ["OTP-based user authentication using Twilio API", "Secure user registration and login system", "Community initiative proposal and collaboration platform", "Secure media upload and file management functionality", "User-generated content handling with Django middleware", "Centralized platform for sharing and supporting community ideas", "Scalable backend architecture using Django framework", "Secure access control and data protection mechanisms"], "short_description": "A Django-based community collaboration platform that enables users to propose and support social initiatives with secure OTP authentication and media-sharing functionality.", "domain": "Web Dev", "tech_stack": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 11]}}, {"model": "portfolio.project", "pk": 3, "fields": {"title": "BlueSky Social Media Automation Bot", "description": "The BlueSky Social Media Automation Bot is a Python-based automation tool designed to interact with the BlueSky social media platform through its API. The bot automates social engagement activities such as liking posts, following users, and unfollowing accounts while maintaining rate-aware execution to ensure efficient and controlled API usage. The project demonstrates strong expertise in RESTful API integration, authentication handling, and scalable automation workflows.", "image": "image/upload/v1777865004/agni0y8bbdt90gvipuh7.png", "github_link": "https://github.com/premsaivalluru/BlueSky-Bot.git", "execution_link": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iGoIMk1EOXSH9dzrkJG1m1C9v9qO5EPF/view?usp=sharing", "features": ["Automated like, follow, and unfollow actions", "Integration with the BlueSky API using Python", "Secure API authentication and token management", "Rate-aware automation to prevent excessive API requests", "Scalable automation workflow architecture", "Programmatic request handling and response processing", "Modular and maintainable Python-based bot logic", "Efficient task execution for social media engagement automation"], "short_description": "Python-based automation bot integrating with the Bluesky API to perform intelligent social media interactions. Features automated like, follow, and unfollow workflows with rate-aware logic, showcasing secure API handling and scalable automation design.", "domain": "Python", "tech_stack": [1, 12]}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 1, "fields": {"name": "Profile Page", "project": 3, "image": "image/upload/v1777865047/wx0dtx3vzur1zqgxu5sa.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 2, "fields": {"name": "Login Page", "project": 3, "image": "image/upload/v1777865066/fkvt5jdkbhg7ahddyafx.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 3, "fields": {"name": "Feed Info Page", "project": 3, "image": "image/upload/v1777865097/ajsflgvt52d0recpe7hz.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 4, "fields": {"name": "Create Post Page", "project": 3, "image": "image/upload/v1777865124/rya1jhxiqlpqd6pq02cs.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 5, "fields": {"name": "Home Page", "project": 2, "image": "image/upload/v1777865155/sjc7l4iti3sjzazettyw.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 6, "fields": {"name": "Register Page", "project": 2, "image": "image/upload/v1777865182/bxi3zbypcsxiyl3uzhht.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 7, "fields": {"name": "Profile Page", "project": 2, "image": "image/upload/v1777865204/jrfpj6xmchuonsbwyao0.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 8, "fields": {"name": "About Page", "project": 2, "image": "image/upload/v1777865233/yh2mklxwmjdgbtvybzdi.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 9, "fields": {"name": "All Posts Page", "project": 2, "image": "image/upload/v1777865256/gcb7dcs3em1tzqruf4mv.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.projectscreenshot", "pk": 10, "fields": {"name": "Home Page", "project": 1, "image": "image/upload/v1777865298/lmal49ysrsn4ane6u2b5.png"}}, {"model": "portfolio.